cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite this repository for the software and calibration protocol. Cite the original GEO datasets and their authors separately when using biological data."
type: software
title: "Algal Bio: public-data calibration and bounded biology research infrastructure"
authors:
  - name: "Hraness contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/0thernet/algal-bio"
url: "https://github.com/0thernet/algal-bio"
license: MIT
abstract: "Reproducible software for registered biology observations, public-data calibration, and explicit research admission limits. The initial lamina pilot is data-limited; prospective research and experimental validation have not been performed. The software license does not relicense third-party research data."
